  "A big plan (thousands of tasks) can make a phone or an old browser slow while the run is going.": "大型计划（数千个任务）在运行期间可能使手机或旧浏览器变慢。",
  "The whole project must be open and calculated on this device.": "整个项目必须在此设备上打开并计算。",
  "The speed of a run depends on the device that starts it.": "运行速度取决于启动它的设备。",
  "Server side computations": "服务器端计算",
  "The run is calculated by the database; this device only checks the proposal, shows it and applies it.": "运行由数据库计算；此设备只检查建议、显示并应用它。",
  "A big plan does not slow your screen: the work is done next to the data.": "大型计划不会拖慢您的屏幕：工作在数据旁完成。",
  "The same speed on a phone and on a computer.": "手机和电脑上速度相同。",
  "The proposal is checked by the scheduler of your screen before you can apply it.": "在您应用之前，建议会由您屏幕的调度器检查。",
  "Needs the SQL update of the database (PART 42); without it the run is calculated on this device and the app says so.": "需要数据库的 SQL 更新（第 42 部分）；否则运行将在此设备上计算，应用会提示。",
  "Calculates only plans of one calendar (Monday to Friday, or every day) with the four kinds of links between tasks and stages, without splits, constraints, task calendars, manual or elapsed tasks, subprojects or schedule from the finish; any other plan is calculated on this device and the app says so.": "仅计算单一日历（周一至周五或每天）、具有任务与阶段之间四种链接的计划，且无拆分、约束、任务日历、手动或持续时间按日历计的任务、子项目或从完成日期排程；其他任何计划都在此设备上计算，应用会提示。",
  "The database has a time limit (5 seconds): a very big plan may need more, then it is calculated on this device and the app says so.": "数据库有时间限制（5 秒）：非常大的计划可能需要更多时间，此时将在此设备上计算，应用会提示。",
  "One more round trip to the database: a small plan is faster on the client side.": "多一次数据库往返：小型计划在客户端更快。",
  "No Fast mode: it needs instant answers from this device.": "无快速模式：它需要此设备即时响应。",
